# Optional: enable the real Anthropic Claude API for command interpretation.
# Without this, the app uses a fully-functional built-in command interpreter,
# so every feature works end-to-end with zero configuration.
#
# WARNING: Putting a real key here exposes it in the browser bundle. Only use a
# throwaway/scoped key for local experimentation. For production, proxy requests
# through a backend instead.
VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
VITE_ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6
